      "lines": [
        {
          "at": 3,
          "speaker": "Elen Reed",
          "text": "Goblins have occupied the lower workings. They have been pillaging the nearby towns and taking people from the roads.",
          "speaker_actor": "mother"
        },
        {
          "at": 12,
          "speaker": "Elen Reed",
          "text": "I never thought they would come this close to Landfall. We follow the lanterns until we find where they are holding her.",
          "speaker_actor": "mother"
        },
        {
          "at": 22,
          "speaker": "Elen Reed",
          "text": "Take the supplies I brought. Healing potions for emergencies, and life and water reagents for your spells.",
          "speaker_actor": "mother"
        },
        {
          "at": 33,
          "speaker": "Elen Reed",
          "text": "Heal restores your own health. Heal Target helps me or a party member. Select the person you mean to heal.",
          "speaker_actor": "mother"
        },
        {
          "at": 44,
          "speaker": "Elen Reed",
          "text": "Restore Ether—some call it Gain Ether—replenishes your mana. A mage who watches only their health will run dry.",
          "speaker_actor": "mother"
        },
        {
          "at": 54,
          "speaker": "Elen Reed",
          "text": "Stay close enough that we can help each other. If I fall, heal me and I can stand with you again.",
          "speaker_actor": "mother"
        }
      ],
